flowchart TD
    U([Your prompt]) --> TAG[Intake: tag D-YYYYMMDD-NN<br/>split into tasks T1..Tn]
    TAG --> REC[Recall from Cammut<br/>only if the task depends on earlier facts]
    REC --> EX{Does a tool, skill or repo already do it?}
    EX -- yes --> REUSE[Use it]
    EX -- no --> SRC[Research, at most 5 sources<br/>score each 0-3]
    REUSE --> PLAN
    SRC --> PLAN
    PLAN[Plan, at most 7 steps<br/>one acceptance check per step] --> PROP[[hoh_propose]]
    PROP --> YES{Software run?<br/>Do you say yes?}
    YES -- no --> WAIT[Stop and ask]
    YES -- yes --> BUILD[Build the smallest increment]
    BUILD --> PROBE[Probe: edge cases and rival options]
    PROBE --> FREEZE[[hoh_freeze]]
    FREEZE --> CHK[Fresh subagent runs each check]
    CHK --> GATE[[hoh_gate]]
    GATE --> D{All true?}
    D -- no --> FIX[Fix the cause]
    FIX --> CYC{Cycle > 3?}
    CYC -- no --> BUILD
    CYC -- yes --> ASK[Stop and ask you]
    D -- yes --> ACC[Accepted]
    ACC --> LEDGER[(Hash-chained ledger)]
    LEDGER --> HERO([Result with evidence level])
